  "body": "[Message retention policies](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/develop/docs/message_retention_policies.md)\r\n\r\nLimitation of the policy\r\n\r\nLimiting the policy works fine for me. Have one room set up for a cleanup for every 24 hours. The server does that too, that's good. But, with the client (e.g. element.io Messenger) this only goes away if you log off the client and log in again.\r\n\r\nHow can I set that the messages are automatically deleted from the client (limitation of the policy)? ",
